<mxfile host="vpdiagram.py"><diagram name="bf01" id="bf01"><mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="760" pageHeight="1085"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="lane0" value="Guest / User" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;startSize=32;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="250" height="1085" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane1" value="System" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;startSize=32;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="0" width="260" height="1085" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane2" value="Operator" style="swimlane;horizontal=1;startSize=32;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="0" width="250" height="1085" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="start" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="113.0" y="48.0" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="1. Register with e-mail,&lt;br&gt;password and the Buyer&lt;br&gt;or Seller role" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25.0" y="93.5" width="200" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="2. Create the Keycloak&lt;br&gt;account and assign&lt;br&gt;the selected role" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="93.5" width="210" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="3. Open onboarding; submit&lt;br&gt;organization details and&lt;br&gt;supporting documents" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15.0" y="183.5" width="220" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="4. Create the PENDING&lt;br&gt;profile; e-mail a&lt;br&gt;verification OTP" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="263.5" width="210" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a5" value="5. Enter the OTP or&lt;br&gt;request a new code" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25.0" y="351.0" width="200" height="48.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a6" value="6. Validate the OTP" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="435.0" width="210" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="E-mail is prefilled, read-only.&lt;br&gt;OTP: 6 digits, valid 10 min,&lt;br&gt;5 attempts, 60 s resend&lt;br&gt;cooldown; a failed send can&lt;br&gt;be resent. KYC review needs&lt;br&gt;a verified e-mail." style="shape=note;size=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="527.5" y="402.0" width="215" height="106.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d1" value="" style="rhombus;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="365.0" y="505.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a7" value="7. Show the error;&lt;br&gt;allow a resend" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="10.0" y="496.0" width="150" height="48.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a8" value="8. Mark the e-mail verified;&lt;br&gt;the profile enters the&lt;br&gt;KYC review queue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270.0" y="568.5" width="220" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a9" value="9. Review the documents&lt;br&gt;and the authority&lt;br&gt;to represent" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535.0" y="648.5" width="200" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d2" value="" style="rhombus;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620.0" y="740.0" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a10" value="10. Verify KYC; record the&lt;br&gt;authorization expiry&lt;br&gt;(or indefinite)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530.0" y="803.5" width="210" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a11" value="11. Set VERIFIED, e-mail&lt;br&gt;the result; trading is&lt;br&gt;allowed if eligible" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="803.5" width="210" height="63.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f1" value="" style="ellipse;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112.0" y="822.0" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f1_name" value="Account verified" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82.30078125" y="854.0" width="85.3984375" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a12" value="12. Reject with&lt;br&gt;a reason" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560.0" y="911.0" width="150" height="48.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a13" value="13. Set REJECTED, e-mail&lt;br&gt;the rejection reason" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275.0" y="911.0" width="210" height="48.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2" value="" style="ellipse;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112.0" y="922.0" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f2_name" value="Account not verified" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72.2890625" y="954.0" width="105.421875" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="Scheduled cleanup (D59), independent of this flow: a self-registered Buyer or Seller whose e-mail is&lt;br&gt;still unverified 24 h after the Keycloak account was created is deleted with its profile. Verified, staff&lt;br&gt;and seed accounts are excluded; resending the OTP does not extend the 24 h. Before KYC approval the&lt;br&gt;user can sign in, but eligibility-gated trading actions are blocked." style="shape=note;size=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="992.0" width="720" height="76.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0.0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="start" target="a1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;exitX=1.0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="380.0" y="215"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a3" target="a4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="125.0" y="295"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1.0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1.0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a4" target="a5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="380.0" y="375"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;exitX=0.7;exitY=1.0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source